SP-694 complete.

## What changed
- `scripts/coverage-policy.mjs`: added `SUITE_DIR_ALLOWLIST` (6 pre-existing
  intentional exclusions: arch, fixtures, fs, helpers, scripts, util) with a
  header documenting the allow-list mechanism and per-entry reasons.
- `tests/coverage/policy.test.mjs`: added `TEST_GLOBS covers every non-empty
  tests/ suite directory (#246)` discovery guard (scans `tests/*/` for non-empty
  suite dirs, fails if any is absent from TEST_GLOBS AND SUITE_DIR_ALLOWLIST) +
  a companion test that rejects stale allow-list entries.

## Verification (scoped contract testCommand)
- `npm run typecheck` → exit 0
- `SPINE_WORKER_STUB=1 node --experimental-strip-types --test tests/coverage/policy.test.mjs`
  → 13/13 pass (11 existing + 2 new)
- eslint --max-warnings 0 on both files → exit 0
- Negative proof: a probe dir `tests/__sp694_probe/` (now removed) made the guard
  fail with exit 1 ("Unaccounted: tests/__sp694_probe"), confirming the guard
  catches omitted suite directories.

Closes #246.
